our project's dataset picker. You can select listed datasets such as COCO8 directly. For other Platform-hosted public datasets, [clone the dataset](data/datasets.md#clone-dataset) into a workspace where you can train and open the copy.\n \n ![Ultralytics Platform Quickstart Training Dialog Cloud Tab](https://cdn.ul.run/i/6ca4d4aa87bf818d83393422aa9f36dc.avif)<!-- screenshot -->\n "}]}}